# Godot's .import files are tracked deliberately. They carry the UID of every imported resource, so
# regenerating them breaks any .tres or .tscn that references a texture or model by uid://, and for
# models they also define the imported node structure. Every consuming project sets the same
# [importer_defaults], so these files stay stable across projects rather than churning.

.godot/

# Windows leaves these behind when Godot rewrites a file in place.
*~RF*.TMP
